  "details": "It is no longer possible to operate the camera while riding on moving objects such as airplanes and cars, which was previously possible.\n\nSpecifically, the pointer to the camera pad is now unstable as before, and on/off operations such as flying, focus, zooming in/out, etc. are no longer possible.\n\nAlso, (this may be more important) operations such as opening social are no longer possible.",
